                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "818bfd06-79d3-3737-8108-d4cae62e2114",
                        "entry_id": "978ecfed-67b7-39b1-bfb0-aad08d288d69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "юр. письменный указ султана или шаха за его подписью (в некоторых мусульманских странах)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "32c8f8d0-35ac-483b-9f62-e4f2dc530980",
                                "sense_id": "818bfd06-79d3-3737-8108-d4cae62e2114",
                                "text": "И австрийского генерального консула, полковника фон Миттерера ждало в Броде неприятное разочарование, так как ни фирман султана, ни берат не были получены тамошним австрийским комендантом, как было обещано."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "73c01808-ab59-475b-a6d3-a639c9033334",
                        "source_entry_id": "978ecfed-67b7-39b1-bfb0-aad08d288d69",
                        "source_sense_id": "818bfd06-79d3-3737-8108-d4cae62e2114",
                        "target_lang_word": "firman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "firman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "172d04b6-216f-3615-99c6-1386cc53b739",
                                        "entry_id": "f05ad287-83b3-3e3d-a2cc-62c327d12723",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A royal decree issued by a sovereign in certain historical Islamic states, especially by the Sultan of Turkey."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7094af5-7d05-4063-b9a0-6837976b7838",
                                                "sense_id": "172d04b6-216f-3615-99c6-1386cc53b739",
                                                "text": "his Sublimity's firman, The most imperative of sovereign spells, / Which every body does without who can […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4d30a77-adbe-4345-93fd-9de4fce36ae8",
                                                "sense_id": "172d04b6-216f-3615-99c6-1386cc53b739",
                                                "text": "He managed to obtain from the vizier a firman bearing the Emir's personal seal and ordering all Bokharan officials to assist the party in every way possible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e0f2e31-0d14-4333-a674-e08985714bab",
                                                "sense_id": "172d04b6-216f-3615-99c6-1386cc53b739",
                                                "text": "It will be noted that the title of Sultan was adopted partly because that of Khedive had been conferred by an Ottoman firman."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
